      6: { text: "return keyword ek value wapas caller ko bhejta hai. add function khud kuch print nahi karta, woh sum wapas de deta hai, aur caller decide karta hai ki usse kya karna hai. Bina return wala function khaas value None wapas bhejta hai. Function ko ek saaf verb naam do, jaise get_average ya send_email. Agar ek function do alag kaam karta hai, to use do functions mein baant do." },
      7: { text: "Functions kyun matter karte hain" },
