    summary: ["Function code ka ek naam wala, dobara use hone wala block hota hai jo def se banta hai.", "Parameters ko call karte time values milti hain; arguments woh values hain jo tum pass karte ho.", "return caller ko ek value wapas bhejta hai; bina return wala function None deta hai.", "Functions code ko chhota, saaf, aur test aur fix karne mein easy banate hain."],
    practice: ["Ek function multiply likho jo do numbers le aur unka product return kare, phir use 6 aur 7 ke saath call karo.", "Ek function is_even likho jo ek number le aur True return kare agar woh even ho aur False agar odd ho.", "Ek function shout likho jo ek word le aur use capital letters mein teen baar print kare."],
