    summary: ["Lambda ek chhota one-line function hota hai: lambda parameters: expression.", "Ye apne expression ki value automatically return karta hai.", "Lambdas ko sorted, map aur filter jaise functions mein seedha pass karna best hai.", "Lambda mein sirf ek expression hota hai, isliye bade kaam ke liye def function chahiye."],
    practice: ["Ek lambda likho jo number ka square return kare aur use map ke saath list par use karo.", "Words ki list ko unke aakhri letter se sort karo, lambda ko key banakar.", "Ek lambda likho jo do numbers mein se bada return kare aur use teen pairs ke saath test karo."],
